From: Paper Linux <paper-linux@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: kindle3: enable IPU dynamic debug at boot

Enable dynamic debug for the restored MX3 IPU driver through the board Barebox
bootargs environment. This preserves all other bootloader-provided arguments.

Signed-off-by: Paper Linux <paper-linux@localhost>

--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm/boards/kindle3/env/nv/linux.bootargs.ipu
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+dyndbg="file drivers/dma/ipu/* +p"
